    {
      "source": "Create a new TransactionInterceptor.",
      "translation": "创建一个新的 TransactionInterceptor。",
      "count": 5
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>ptm</code> - the default transaction manager to perform the actual transaction management",
      "translation": "<code>ptm</code> - 用于执行实际事务管理的默认事务管理器",
      "count": 4
    },
    {
      "source": "in favor of <a href=\"TransactionAspectSupport.html#setTransactionAttributes(java.util.Properties)\"><code>TransactionAspectSupport.setTransactionAttributes(Properties)</code></a>",
      "translation": "支持<a href=\"TransactionAspectSupport.html#setTransactionAttributes(java.util.Properties)\"><code>TransactionAspectSupport.setTransactionAttributes(Properties)</code></a>",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "in favor of\n<a href=\"#%3Cinit%3E(org.springframework.transaction.TransactionManager,org.springframework.transaction.interceptor.TransactionAttributeSource)\"><code>TransactionInterceptor(TransactionManager, TransactionAttributeSource)</code></a>",
      "translation": "支持使用 `<a href=\"#%3Cinit%3E(org.springframework.transaction.TransactionManager,org.springframework.transaction.interceptor.TransactionAttributeSource)\"><code>TransactionInterceptor(TransactionManager, TransactionAttributeSource)</code></a>` 构造函数。",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>tas</code> - the attribute source to be used to find transaction attributes",
      "translation": "<code>tas</code> - 用于查找事务属性的属性源",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "Derives from the <a href=\"TransactionAspectSupport.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.transaction.interceptor\"><code>TransactionAspectSupport</code></a> class which\ncontains the integration with Spring's underlying transaction API.\nTransactionInterceptor simply calls the relevant superclass methods\nsuch as <a href=\"TransactionAspectSupport.html#invokeWithinTransaction(java.lang.reflect.Method,java.lang.Class,org.springframework.transaction.interceptor.TransactionAspectSupport.InvocationCallback)\"><code>TransactionAspectSupport.invokeWithinTransaction(Method, Class, TransactionAspectSupport.InvocationCallback)</code></a> in the correct order.",
      "translation": "继承自包含与 Spring 底层事务 API 集成的 <a href=\"TransactionAspectSupport.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.transaction.interceptor\"><code>TransactionAspectSupport</code></a> 类。\nTransactionInterceptor 只需按正确顺序调用相关的父类方法，例如 <a href=\"TransactionAspectSupport.html#invokeWithinTransaction(java.lang.reflect.Method,java.lang.Class,org.springframework.transaction.interceptor.TransactionAspectSupport.InvocationCallback)\"><code>TransactionAspectSupport.invokeWithinTransaction(Method, Class, TransactionAspectSupport.InvocationCallback)</code></a>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "TransactionInterceptors are thread-safe.",
      "translation": "TransactionInterceptors 是线程安全的。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Transaction manager and transaction attributes still need to be set.",
      "translation": "事务管理器（transaction manager）和事务属性（transaction attributes）仍需设置。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>attributes</code> - the transaction attributes in properties format",
      "translation": "<code>attributes</code> - 以属性格式表示的事务属性",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Rod Johnson, Juergen Hoeller, Sebastien Deleuze",
      "translation": "Rod Johnson，Juergen Hoeller，Sebastien Deleuze",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<span class=\"description-from-type-label\">Description copied from interface: <code><a href=\"../../../aopalliance/intercept/MethodInterceptor.html#invoke(org.aopalliance.intercept.MethodInvocation)\">MethodInterceptor</a></code></span>",
      "translation": "<span class=\"description-from-type-label\">描述从接口复制：<code><a href=\"../../../aopalliance/intercept/MethodInterceptor.html#invoke(org.aopalliance.intercept.MethodInvocation)\">MethodInterceptor</a></code></span>",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Implement this method to perform extra treatments before and\nafter the invocation. Polite implementations would certainly\nlike to invoke <a href=\"../../../aopalliance/intercept/Joinpoint.html#proceed()\"><code>Joinpoint.proceed()</code></a>.",
      "translation": "实现此方法以在调用之前和之后执行额外处理。礼貌的实现肯定会调用<a href=\"../../../aopalliance/intercept/Joinpoint.html#proceed()\"><code>Joinpoint.proceed()</code></a>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Implement this method to perform extra treatments before and\nafter the invocation.",
      "translation": "实现此方法以在调用前后执行额外处理。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<code><a href=\"../../../aopalliance/intercept/MethodInterceptor.html#invoke(org.aopalliance.intercept.MethodInvocation)\">invoke</a></code> in interface <code><a href=\"../../../aopalliance/intercept/MethodInterceptor.html\" title=\"interface in org.aopalliance.intercept\">MethodInterceptor</a></code>",
      "translation": "`<code><a href=\"../../../aopalliance/intercept/MethodInterceptor.html#invoke(org.aopalliance.intercept.MethodInvocation)\">invoke</a></code>` 在接口 `<code><a href=\"../../../aopalliance/intercept/MethodInterceptor.html\" title=\"interface in org.aopalliance.intercept\">MethodInterceptor</a></code>` 中",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "the result of the call to <a href=\"../../../aopalliance/intercept/Joinpoint.html#proceed()\"><code>Joinpoint.proceed()</code></a>;\nmight be intercepted by the interceptor",
      "translation": "调用<a href=\"../../../aopalliance/intercept/Joinpoint.html#proceed()\"><code>Joinpoint.proceed()</code></a>的结果；可能会被拦截器拦截。",
      "count": 1
    },
